/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The financial implications of inadequate cooling in data centers are significant. Overheating can lead to frequent hardware replacements and increased maintenance costs. For example, a data center with 1,000 servers might experience an annual failure rate of 5% due to overheating, leading to replacement costs of approximately $2,000 per server. )
/Alt ()
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
